{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Copy diagnostic report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "View or save report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看或保存报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report copied. Return to your chat and paste it." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告已复制，返回聊天后粘贴即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Captured report (does not update while open)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已生成的报告（打开期间不会随实时读数变化）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save report to Files" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存报告到文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the system share sheet is unavailable, copy the report or save the text file instead." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果无法打开系统分享面板，可以直接复制报告或保存为文本文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal validation report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度验证报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Case visibility report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电盒可见性报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last completed case check" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次完成的充电盒检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal validation" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度验证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live temperature sensors" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时温度传感器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calibration channels" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "校准通道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 17 Pro Max (iPhone18,2): previous real-device sensor observations confirmed battery, charger and PMU readings. Recorded samples are covered by regression tests; this installation still requires fresh device testing and external calibration." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 17 Pro Max（iPhone18,2）：此前真机采样已获得电池、充电芯片及 PMU 温度读数，历史样本已纳入回归测试。当前安装版本仍需重新进行真机验证和外部仪器校准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensor names and scales vary by model and OS. Current readable channels are shown above; these counts do not establish hardware calibration." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传感器名称和量程随设备及系统版本变化。上方显示当前可用通道数量，不代表已经完成硬件校准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded sentinel values remain in Raw data. Calibration channels are not live hotspots. The heat map is schematic, not a calibrated image of the device interior." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被排除的异常值仍保留于原始数据。校准通道不是实时热点。热力图仅为示意，不是经校准的设备内部热成像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share thermal validation report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享温度验证报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calibration (not a live hotspot)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "校准值（非实时热点）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensor names and scales vary by device and OS. WattTrace includes real-device observations from iPhone 17 Pro Max (iPhone18,2); see Thermal for current sensor coverage and a shareable validation report. A plausible reading is not proof of accuracy or hardware calibration." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传感器名称和量程随设备及系统变化。WattTrace 已纳入 iPhone 17 Pro Max（iPhone18,2）的真机采样记录；请在发热页面查看当前传感器覆盖及可分享的验证报告。合理的读数并不证明测量精度或硬件校准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "External accessory records" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外部配件记录数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last accessory check" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近配件检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh accessory records" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刷新配件记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check case-open broadcasts (10 seconds)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查充电盒开盖广播（10 秒）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard battery discovery is filtered to 180F. The separate case-open check only counts visible BLE advertisements without connecting. Open your own AirPods case next to the phone before starting." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准电量查找筛选 180F。独立的开盖检查只统计可见 BLE 广播，不连接设备。开始前请在手机附近打开自己的 AirPods 充电盒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Case-open broadcast visibility" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电盒开盖广播可见性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visible BLE reports" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可见 BLE 广播数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple manufacturer reports" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 厂商数据报告数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proximity-shaped reports" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "近距离配对格式报告数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods-named reports" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称含 AirPods 的报告数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report limit reached; the visibility scan stopped early." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已达到报告数量上限，可见性扫描提前结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are anonymous advertisement counts, not distinct devices, verified case identity or battery readings. Apple proximity-shaped data may come from other nearby devices. Zero reports does not prove the case is not broadcasting." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是匿名广播计数，不代表不同设备数量、已验证的充电盒身份或电量读数。类似 Apple 近距离配对格式的数据也可能来自其他附近设备。零条报告不能证明充电盒没有广播。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share case visibility report" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分享充电盒可见性报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking visible BLE broadcasts" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查可见 BLE 广播"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no background scanning, proprietary AirPods battery decoding, forced pairing or automatic connection. Standard battery reads disconnect on completion or timeout; the case-open check never connects." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不进行后台扫描、AirPods 私有电量解码、强制配对或自动连接。标准电量读取完成或超时后释放连接；开盖检查从不连接设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth battery diagnostic" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "蓝牙电量诊断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard battery service" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准电池服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check supported Bluetooth accessories" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查支持的蓝牙配件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find battery devices" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找电池设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find connected devices" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查找已连接设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan for battery service (10 seconds)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描电池服务（10 秒）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth access is requested only when you start a check. Nearby discovery is filtered to the standard Battery Service. Choose a listed accessory before WattTrace connects to read it." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在你主动开始检查时请求蓝牙权限。附近设备扫描仅筛选标准电池服务。选择列表中的配件后，WattTrace 才连接读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No matching Battery Service devices were returned. This does not mean your AirPods are disconnected or that their battery is empty." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未返回匹配标准电池服务的设备。这不代表 AirPods 未连接或电量为零。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discovered battery devices" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已发现电池设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-connected candidate" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统已连接候选设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery Service advertisement" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池服务广播"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read battery" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取电量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is the peripheral's reported name, not a verified model or physical identity. Repeat discovery to read a device again." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称来自外设自身报告，不代表已验证的型号或物理身份。如需再次读取，请重新查找。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery Service results" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池服务读取结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected accessory" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选配件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read completed" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取完成时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery service %lld" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池服务 %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiple Battery Service instances are kept separate. Without a verified component mapping, WattTrace does not label them left ear, right ear or case." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多个电池服务实例分别显示。没有经过验证的部件映射时，不标为左耳、右耳或充电盒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods and accessory limits" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods 与配件限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This reads only the public Bluetooth Battery Service (180F) and Battery Level characteristic (2A19). AirPods 4 may not expose these to a third-party app. Audio-route detection alone does not establish battery access." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅通过公开的蓝牙电池服务（180F）及电量特征（2A19）读取数据。AirPods 4 可能不会向第三方 App 暴露这些接口。音频路由识别不等于拥有电量权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no background scanning, proprietary AirPods broadcast decoding, forced pairing or automatic connection. The diagnostic disconnects its local connection when the read finishes or times out." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不进行后台扫描、AirPods 私有广播解码、强制配对或自动连接。读取完成或超时后，诊断会断开本 App 的局部连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For unavailable left/right/case readings, check the system Batteries widget. No battery percentage is fabricated from signal strength, audio connection or charge state." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左右耳或充电盒电量不可用时，请查看系统电池小组件。不根据 RSSI、音频连接或充电状态捏造电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready for a manual battery check" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待手动检查电量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing Bluetooth" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在准备蓝牙"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for Battery Service" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查找电池服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discovery complete" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备查找完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to selected accessory" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在连接所选配件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading standard battery characteristics" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在读取标准电量特征"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery read finished" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电量读取结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth permission denied" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "蓝牙权限被拒绝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth is off" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "蓝牙已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bluetooth unavailable on this device" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此设备不支持蓝牙检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard battery data unavailable" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标准电池数据不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery check timed out" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电量检查超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery check cancelled" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电量检查已取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessory connection or read failed" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配件连接或读取失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured battery level" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实测电量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid Battery Level value" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无效的电量值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BatteryCenter returned no devices. Connected accessories may still be present in the system Batteries widget." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BatteryCenter 未返回设备。已连接的配件仍可能显示在系统电池小组件中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessory battery service unavailable." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配件电量服务不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BatteryCenter loaded but returned an empty device list. Previous sandboxed-device tests showed powerd XPC access failures. An empty list alone does not establish the reason on this device." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BatteryCenter 已加载，但返回空设备列表。此前沙盒真机测试出现过 powerd XPC 访问失败。仅凭空列表无法确定当前设备的具体原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No external accessory battery records were returned." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未返回外部配件电量记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BatteryCenter records" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BatteryCenter 记录数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods battery percentages, left/right and case levels require actual battery records. The audio output name is not a substitute for those readings." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods 电量、左右耳及充电盒电量需要实际电池记录。音频输出名称不能替代这些读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current audio output" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前音频输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No audio output route was returned for WattTrace." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WattTrace 未获得音频输出路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio port type" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音频端口类型"
          }
        }
      }
