    "File saved" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件已保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export failed" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出失败"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export scope" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Completed sessions" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已完成会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved curve samples" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存曲线采样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only completed sessions are exported. Saved curves may be thinned and are not the full one-second sensor stream. The SOC and thermal aggregates retain their own measured durations." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅导出已完成会话。已保存曲线可能经过抽稀，并非完整的每秒传感器数据流。SOC 与热分析汇总保留各自的有效测量时长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV uses UTF-8 with a BOM, decimal points and UTC timestamps. Temperatures are always Celsius. Blank fields are unavailable; legacy zero values are flagged separately. JSON contains the analysis statistics and unmodified text labels." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV 使用带 BOM 的 UTF-8、小数点和 UTC 时间戳。温度始终使用摄氏度。空白字段表示不可用，旧版零值另有标记。JSON 包含分析统计数据和未修改的文本标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local file export" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地文件导出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WattTrace does not upload this file. You choose its destination in Files. Timestamps, charger names and manual labels can be identifying; review the file before sharing it." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WattTrace 不会上传此文件。你可在“文件”中选择保存位置。时间戳、充电器名称及手动标签可能包含个人信息，分享前请检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older sessions do not contain per-sample voltages, currents or full thermal states. New recordings include these where available; unavailable fields remain blank." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "旧会话没有保存各采样点的电压、电流及完整热压力状态。新记录会在可用时保存这些数据，不可用字段仍留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session summary (CSV)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会话总览（CSV）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved curve samples (CSV)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "历史曲线采样（CSV）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SOC bands (CSV)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOC 分段（CSV）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal relationships (CSV)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热分析结果（CSV）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete analysis (JSON)" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整分析（JSON）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One row per session, including energy, measurement coverage, labels and charging-path resistance." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次会话一行，包括能量、测量覆盖率、标签和充电路径电阻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One row per saved curve point with UTC timestamp, offset, stored and analysis-compatible power, temperature and any recorded rail details. Useful for aligning an external power meter." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个已保存曲线采样点一行，包含 UTC 时间戳、时间偏移、原存功率及用于分析的功率、温度和已记录电源轨详情，便于与外置功率计对齐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both 5% and 10% SOC summaries, with mean, peak, measurement time and thermal-state durations. Filter by band width before aggregating." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含 5% 与 10% 两种 SOC 汇总，以及均值、峰值、测量时长和热压力时长。汇总时请先按区间宽度筛选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One row per power rail and temperature channel, with within-SOC correlation, slope, paired coverage and matched thermal-pressure comparison. Pressure fields repeat for each temperature channel." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个功率测量侧与温度通道一行，包含同 SOC 相关系数、斜率、配对覆盖率和匹配热压力对比。热压力字段在不同温度通道中重复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Versioned JSON containing session metadata, stored curve points, both SOC band widths, thermal sufficient statistics and calculated thermal relationships." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带版本号的 JSON，包含会话元数据、历史曲线采样、两种 SOC 区间、热分析累计统计及计算结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal and power analysis" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度与功率分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power changes versus SOC and temperature" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOC、温度与功率变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Same-level thermal comparisons and coverage" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同电量热压力对比及覆盖率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analysis settings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power rail" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功率测量侧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature channel" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度通道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hotspot temperature" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热点温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal statistics reconstructed from the saved curve may omit intervals or contain legacy zero values. Earlier records have only high versus non-high thermal pressure." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由历史曲线回算的热分析可能缺失区间或包含旧版零值。旧记录仅区分高热压力与非高热压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SOC data source" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOC 数据来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal data source" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热分析数据来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power versus battery level" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功率随电量变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First eligible band" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首个有效区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last eligible band" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后有效区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last minus first" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "末段减首段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "First band measured" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首段测量时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last band measured" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "末段测量时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No SOC band has enough valid power measurements." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有 SOC 区间具有足够的有效功率测量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each dot is a 5% band mean with at least 10 measured seconds. Full-charge hold at 100% is excluded. A fall across SOC is descriptive, not proof of a particular limiter." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个点是至少有 10 秒有效测量的 5% SOC 区间均值。排除 100% 满电保持。功率随电量下降属于描述性结果，不能证明某种限功率机制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature relationship at equal SOC" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同电量温度相关性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired temperature and power" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度与功率共同测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Correlation r" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相关系数 r"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power slope" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功率斜率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modelled interval time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纳入模型的时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paired intervals" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有效配对区间数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched integer SOC levels" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配的整数电量数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A negative slope means higher temperatures were associated with lower power at the same displayed battery percentage. A positive slope means the opposite; neither proves causation." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "负斜率表示相同显示电量下，较高温度与较低功率相关；正斜率相反。两者都不证明因果关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Insufficient duration or temperature/power variation for a useful within-level correlation. No relationship is inferred." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测量时长或温度、功率变化不足，无法计算有意义的同电量相关性，不推断相关关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only simultaneous valid interval midpoints are paired. Values are centered separately at each integer SOC, not compared across different charge levels. Minimum support: 20 seconds and 3 intervals per level, 60 seconds and 6 intervals overall, with measurable variation." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅配对同时有效的区间中点读数。分别在各整数电量内中心化，不跨电量比较。最低要求：每个电量 20 秒及 3 个区间，总计 60 秒及 6 个区间，并具有可测量变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power at different thermal pressure" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不同热压力下的功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lower-pressure power time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "较低热压力功率测量时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High-pressure power time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高热压力功率测量时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nominal / fair" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正常 / 轻度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serious / critical" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "严重 / 临界"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High minus lower" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高热压力减低热压力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched SOC values" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配的电量值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched lower-pressure time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配的低热压力时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched high-pressure time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配的高热压力时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No integer battery level has at least 20 seconds of measured power in both pressure groups. A thermal power difference is not inferred." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有整数电量同时具有两组各至少 20 秒的功率测量，不推断热压力功率差。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare nominal/fair against serious/critical only at shared integer SOC levels. Both groups use the smaller measured duration as their common weight. Unknown or changing endpoint states are excluded. System thermal pressure is not a direct charging-controller limit." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在共同整数电量下比较正常/轻度与严重/临界热压力。两组使用较短有效时长作为共同权重。排除状态未知或两端变化的区间。系统热压力不等于充电控制器的直接限功率状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interpretation and limits" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结果解读与限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thermal model uses intervals at unchanged integer battery levels, not exact physical SOC. Gaps over 10 seconds, missing SOC, pauses and 100% hold are excluded. Coverage refers to these observed intervals, not to the entire charge." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "热分析使用显示整数电量未变化的区间，不代表精确物理 SOC。排除超过 10 秒的空档、缺失电量、暂停及满电保持。覆盖率以这些观测区间为分母，而非整次充电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are observational associations, not independent experimental effects or statistical significance tests. Power can also heat the phone. Charger negotiation, ambient temperature, workload, battery state and unmeasured factors may explain the changes." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是观测相关性，不是独立实验效应或统计显著性检验。功率本身也可能使手机发热。充电协商、环境温度、负载、电池状态及其他未测因素均可能解释变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery-rail watts remain signed. Missing input measurements are never substituted with zero. Temperature slope uses the selected display unit; hotspot means the hottest accepted sensor, which may change identity." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池轨功率保留正负号。缺失的输入功率不会被替换为零。温度斜率随所选单位换算；热点为当前最高有效温度传感器，其身份可能发生变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare sessions" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电记录对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare at the same battery level" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相同电量区间对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power, temperature and thermal pressure" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "功率、温度和热压力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No comparable intervals" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有可比区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected metric needs at least 10 measured seconds in a common 5% sub-band on both sides. Try the battery rail or choose another session." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选指标要求两次记录在共同的 5% 子区间内均有至少 10 秒有效测量。可以尝试电池轨指标或选择另一条记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose different sessions" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择不同的会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select two distinct completed charging sessions." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择两次不同的已完成充电会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select sessions" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择充电记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session A" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 A"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Session B" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录 B"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swap A and B" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交换 A 与 B"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comparison settings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对比设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comparison metric" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对比指标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched SOC comparison" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同 SOC 区间对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld matched bands" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 个匹配区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only jointly measured bands are plotted. Their x-position follows the matched sub-bands; missing bands are not interpolated." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只绘制两次会话均有有效测量的区间。横坐标对应匹配子区间，无数据区间不做插值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "B minus A" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B 减 A"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matched sub-bands" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配子区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured A" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A 有效测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured B" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B 有效测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shared weighting time" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共同加权时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough shared measurements for this metric." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该指标的共同有效测量不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comparison method" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对比方法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each common 5% sub-band requires at least 10 valid measured seconds per session. A 10% comparison uses only the shared 5% sub-bands, with the smaller measured duration as the weight on both sides. 100% is separate." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共同的每个 5% 子区间要求两次会话各有至少 10 秒有效测量。10% 对比只使用共同的 5% 子区间，并以两次测量中较短的有效时长作为相同权重。100% 独立统计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A and B show matched, interval-weighted values, not whole-session averages. Coverage is measured time divided by observed time within the matched sub-bands; unrecorded time is excluded. B minus A is signed, not a ranking." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A、B 显示匹配区间的时长加权数值，而非整次会话均值。覆盖率为匹配子区间内有效测量时长除以观测时长，不包括未记录时段。B 减 A 保留正负号，不表示优劣排名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An identical adapter name or a user test label does not verify the physical charger or cable. Match the charge level, starting temperature, phone usage and environment before interpreting differences." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相同的适配器名称或用户填写的标签不能证明是同一实体充电器或线缆。分析差异时应尽量控制电量、初始温度、手机使用情况和环境条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At least one session was reconstructed from its saved curve. Older missing values, carried-forward levels or thinned samples can make this comparison less reliable." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少一条会话由历史曲线回算。旧版缺失值、沿用的电量或抽稀后的采样可能降低对比可靠性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mean hotspot temperature" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平均热点温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test label" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试标签"
          }
        }
      }
