    "Charger, cable or test conditions" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电器、线缆或测试条件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional manual label, for example: Apple 40 W · Cable A · case off. Leave blank to clear it. This does not change sensor readings." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选手动标签，例如：Apple 40 W · 线缆 A · 不戴壳。留空即可清除，不会改变传感器数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path resistance comparison" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电路径电阻对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These records share a reported adapter name, not a verified physical charger. The estimate includes adapter regulation, cable and both contacts." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些记录的适配器报告名称相同，但无法确认是同一实体充电器。估算值包含适配器调节、线缆及两端接触电阻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This estimate is close to the lowest recorded path resistance for this reported adapter name." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该估算值接近此适配器报告名称下记录到的最低路径电阻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ above the lowest estimate for this reported adapter name. Cable, contacts, charger regulation and test conditions may all contribute." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比此适配器报告名称下的最低估算值高 %@。线缆、接触情况、适配器调节和测试条件都可能产生影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SOC band analysis" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOC 分段分析"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power and thermal by battery level" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按电量分析功率和温度"
          }
        }
