        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SOC 采样数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Within-band observed" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "区间内有效观测时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconstructed from the saved curve. Older or thinned samples may omit intervals or contain legacy zero values, and the original thermal states cannot be recovered." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由已保存的曲线回算。较早或抽稀后的采样可能缺少部分区间，旧版本的零值可能有歧义，且无法恢复原始的完整热压力等级。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Intervals longer than 10 seconds, missing battery levels and band crossings are excluded. 100% is its own band. Means use only valid pairs of readings; peaks can include isolated samples." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过 10 秒的采样间隔、电量缺失和跨区间的间隔均不累计。100% 独立统计。均值仅使用两端均有效的读数；峰值可包含独立采样点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live sensor aggregation" : {
      "localizations": {
