    "Mean battery rail" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "平均电池轨功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dots are measured interval-weighted means at each band's midpoint. Missing bands have no dot. Battery-rail watts are signed: negative means net discharge." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆点或方点代表各区间中点的实测时长加权均值。无数据的区间不绘制点。电池轨功率保留正负符号，负值表示净放电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No continuous power intervals could be measured in these bands." : {
      "localizations": {
