    "Live sensor coverage" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时传感器覆盖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power rails, thermal sensors and model notes" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电源轨、温度传感器及机型说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device profile" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备档案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raw HID readings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始 HID 读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merged HID readings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合并后 HID 读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Energy reference" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池能量参考值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Simulator data is not evidence of hardware sensor compatibility." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模拟器数据不能作为真机硬件传感器兼容性的依据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live power coverage" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时功率数据覆盖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery rail current" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池轨电流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured input power" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实测输入功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Partial input reading" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不完整的输入读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery rail power" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池轨功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Negotiated profile" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已协商供电档位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dash means no usable reading at this moment. A numeric zero is an actual reading, but a zero-voltage rail is not evidence of active charging. The negotiated profile is a ceiling, not measured input power." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "横线表示此刻没有可用读数。数字 0 是实际读到的值，但电源轨电压为 0 并不表示正在充电。协商档位是上限，不是实测输入功率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thermal coverage" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度数据覆盖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accepted temperature readings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纳入计算的温度读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded temperature readings" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已排除的温度读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery temperature sensors" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池温度传感器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raw data retains the original sensor values. Excluded and calibration readings do not become the hottest-component measurement." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始数据保留传感器原值。被排除的读数和校准值不会参与最高部件温度的计算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 17 Pro Max profile" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 17 Pro Max 专项档案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Model-specific notes" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机型专项说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USB-C input and battery-rail sensors have been observed on this model. Their readings still need comparison with an external meter across different charge levels and adapters." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此机型已观测到 USB-C 输入侧和电池轨传感器。仍需在不同电量与适配器条件下使用外置功率计交叉验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PMU tdev7 and tdev8 have returned approximately −25 °C while nearby sensors were warm. The upstream rejection rule excludes tdev readings below −10 °C from derived temperatures without deleting the raw data. PMU tcal is treated as calibration, not a live hotspot." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PMU tdev7 和 tdev8 曾返回约 −25 °C，而附近传感器温度正常偏高。上游规则会将低于 −10 °C 的 tdev 读数排除在派生温度之外，同时保留原始数据。PMU tcal 作为校准值，不视为实时热点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MagSafe input current and cable identity remain unverified or unavailable. A USB-C reading or a negotiated profile does not prove wireless input watts or cable e-marker access." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MagSafe 输入电流和线缆身份信息尚未验证或无法获取。USB-C 读数或协商档位不能证明无线输入瓦数或线缆 e-marker 可读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery energy presets for both SIM-tray and eSIM-only hardware are in Settings → Battery energy. The model identifier is not enough to choose between them." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带实体 SIM 卡槽和纯 eSIM 硬件的电池能量预设位于“设置 → 电池能量”。仅凭机型标识无法区分两种硬件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sensor coverage is evaluated from the current snapshot, not from a static compatibility promise. It can change with the charger, battery state, iOS release and hardware revision." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "传感器覆盖根据当前采样结果判断，不是固定的兼容性承诺。充电器、电池状态、iOS 版本及硬件版本都可能影响读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This page does not run extra HID or accessory scans. It reuses the normal WattTrace snapshot; use Raw data for detailed diagnosis." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此页面不会额外扫描 HID 或配件，而是复用 WattTrace 的常规采样。详细诊断请查看原始数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 17 Pro Max battery presets" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 17 Pro Max 电池预设"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Physical SIM tray" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "带实体 SIM 卡槽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "eSIM-only hardware" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纯 eSIM 硬件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both hardware variants share iPhone18,2. Select the variant by the presence of a physical SIM tray, not by whether an eSIM is currently active. These are approximate rated energy presets, not measured usable battery capacity." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两种硬件均使用 iPhone18,2 标识。请根据是否有实体 SIM 卡槽选择，而不是根据当前是否启用 eSIM。这些是估算的额定能量预设，并非实测可用电池容量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original 19.7 Wh fallback assumes the larger pack; it does not identify your hardware. Your existing custom value is preserved until you choose a preset." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原有的 19.7 Wh 默认值假定使用较大的电池，并不代表已识别你的硬件。主动选择预设前，现有自定义数值保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Monitor" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统监控"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WattTrace CPU" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WattTrace CPU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App CPU" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App CPU 占用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用户态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display timing" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕刷新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Observed callbacks" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回调频率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maximum refresh" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕最高刷新率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode On" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低电量模式已开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low Power Mode Off" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "低电量模式已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measurement scope" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测量说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Performance and display" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "性能与显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WattTrace CPU · FPS · thermal state" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WattTrace CPU · 帧率 · 发热状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU time used by WattTrace itself, averaged over the last sample interval. This is not total iPhone CPU use. 100% means one fully busy logical core; a multithreaded app can exceed 100%." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里显示的是 WattTrace 自身进程在最近采样间隔内的 CPU 使用率，不是整台 iPhone 的 CPU 占用率。100% 表示一个逻辑核心满负荷运行，多线程 App 的数值可以超过 100%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Observed is the CADisplayLink callback frequency while this screen is visible. It is not a direct hardware panel measurement or the frame rate of other apps. iOS may lower it for power, temperature, or display scheduling." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里显示的是本页面可见时 CADisplayLink 的实际回调频率，不是屏幕硬件寄存器读数，也不是其他 App 的帧率。iOS 可能因电量、温度或显示调度而降低频率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the official system thermal-pressure category, not a temperature in degrees. For available physical sensor values, open the Thermal tab." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 iOS 官方系统发热压力等级，并非以度数表示的温度。可用的真实温度传感器读数请查看“温度”标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These performance readings use public system interfaces and do not depend on the private charging sensor backend." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些性能指标使用公开的系统接口，不依赖充电模块的私有传感器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sampling runs only with System Monitor open and WattTrace active. Readings reset when the screen is closed or the app is backgrounded." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在打开系统监控页面且 WattTrace 处于前台时采样。关闭页面或 App 进入后台后，读数会重置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A precise whole-device CPU percentage or numeric CPU temperature is not available from this panel; do not compare these figures with hardware-level diagnostics as if they were the same measurement." : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此页面无法获得精确的全设备 CPU 占用率或 CPU 实际摄氏温度；请勿将这些指标与硬件级诊断数据视为同一种测量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input measured" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "输入侧采样时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cell measured" : {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池侧采样时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%@ above the best this charger has recorded. Same charger, so that difference is the cable and the plugs — not the adapter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比该充电器的最好记录高 %@。充电器相同，所以这个差值来自线缆和插头，不是适配器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ at the port" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端口实测 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sessions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 次充电"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "around %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "约 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "at the current draw" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按当前取电"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic follows your region and the Temperature setting under General › Language & Region in the Settings app, which is %@ on this device. Applies to the app, the floating meter, the Live Activity and the widget. Raw data always shows the sensors' own °C." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”跟随你的地区，以及“设置” App 中“通用 › 语言与地区”下的“温度”选项，本机当前为 %@。此设置对 App、悬浮读数、实时活动和小组件都生效。原始数据始终显示传感器自身的 °C。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery level check: rising at about %@ W against %@ W measured at the cell — too far apart to agree, too close to call. It is worked out for a %@ Wh battery; if that is not your phone's, set it in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电量核对：按电量上升推算约 %1$@ W，电芯实测为 %2$@ W —— 差距大到不算一致，又不足以下结论。以上按 %3$@ Wh 的电池能量计算；如果与你的手机不符，请在设置中修改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery level check: rising at about %@ W, in line with the %@ W the cell sensors measure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电量核对：按电量上升推算约 %1$@ W，与电芯传感器测得的 %2$@ W 一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable and connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线缆与连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cable comparison" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "线缆对比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge forecast" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电预估"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Either way this is the whole path — the charger's own regulation, the cable and both plugs — not the cable alone, so it reads best as a comparison between cables on the same charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两种算法给出的都是整条通路——充电器自身的稳压、线缆和两端插头——而不是线缆本身，所以它最适合用来在同一个充电器上横向比较不同的线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fahrenheit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "华氏度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fitted over %@ of current swing, with %@ of it on the line." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 %@ 的电流变化范围内拟合，其中 %@ 落在这条直线上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "fitted over the whole contract" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在整段合约上拟合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "from one sample" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单次采样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From one sample, against the negotiated %@. That figure is a ceiling rather than a measurement, so read this as an order of magnitude. Once the current moves — the taper past 80%%, thermal throttling, the phone's own load — it is replaced by a fit that needs no reference at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单次采样，以协商出的 %@ 为参考。那个值是天花板而不是测量值，所以只能当数量级看。一旦电流动起来——80%% 之后的涓流、热降频、手机自身的负载——它就会被一个完全不需要参考值的拟合结果取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get ${metric}" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取${metric}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get ${metric} in ${unit}" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取${metric}（${unit}）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Reading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High for a charging path. A thinner or longer cable, a worn plug or a loose fit all look like this. Trying another cable on the same charger is the way to tell which." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对充电通路来说偏高。线更细、更长，插头磨损，或接触松动，看起来都是这样。在同一个充电器上换一根线，才能分清是哪一种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lost in the path" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路损耗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low. Nothing in this connection is holding the charge back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低。这条连接没有拖慢充电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "may read half" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能只读到一半"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "of the current on offer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占可用电流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the iPhone 18 Pro, wired charging above about 30 W can read about half on every sensor here: people with an inline meter saw the input and the cell figures both at half the real power. Nothing is corrected. Once the battery level has risen a few percent, it is used to check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 iPhone 18 Pro 上，有线充电超过约 30 W 时，这里所有传感器的读数都可能只有实际的一半：有用户串接功率计测得，输入和电芯两侧的数值都只有实际功率的一半。这里不做修正。电量上升几个百分点后，会用电量变化来核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordinary for a long or thin cable. It costs a little power as heat, and at these currents it is unlikely to change how fast the phone charges." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对较长或较细的线缆来说很常见。会有少量功率变成热，在这样的电流下不太会影响充电速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path resistance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通路电阻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rated for this model: %@ Wh (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机型额定：%1$@ Wh（%2$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "reading low" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读数偏低"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads one value from the phone's sensors at the moment the action runs. When a sensor does not answer, the action returns no value — never 0, and never an older reading — so a shortcut can tell the difference." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在动作运行的那一刻从手机传感器读取一个值。传感器没有应答时，动作返回“无值”——不会返回 0，也不会返回之前的读数——这样快捷指令能分辨出来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取电比例"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature unit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The battery level is rising %@× as fast as the cell sensors account for — about %@ W from the level against %@ W measured — so they are seeing only part of the charge, and the figures here are low. Nothing is corrected. Worked out for a %@ Wh battery; the right value for yours goes in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电量上升的速度是电芯传感器所能解释的 %1$@ 倍 —— 按电量推算约 %2$@ W，实测只有 %3$@ W —— 说明传感器只测到了部分充电功率，这里的数值偏低。这里不做修正。以上按 %4$@ Wh 的电池能量计算；你的手机的正确数值请在设置中填写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lowest path resistance recorded on this charger. Whatever was plugged in here is as good as it has seen." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是该充电器上记录到的最低通路电阻。这次用的线和插法，已经是它见过最好的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rail is collapsing under load. The phone is taking well under what the charger offered, and the voltage at the port is far below what was negotiated — the current is being held down to stop it falling further. Try another cable on this charger: if the drop shrinks, it was the cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "供电轨在负载下塌陷。手机取的电远低于充电器给出的额度，端口电压也远低于协商值——电流正被压着，以免电压继续往下掉。在这个充电器上换一根线试试：压降变小，就是线的问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The temperatures are measured; the positions are not. iOS reports sensor names and values and no coordinates at all, so each zone is drawn at a fixed spot that follows the layout of an iPad Pro 11-inch — logic board down the middle between two battery cells, charge IC by the USB-C port. Other iPads are built differently. Read this as a legend for the sensor lists, not as a map of your iPad." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度数据为实际测量值，但位置并非如此。iOS 仅报告传感器名称和数值，完全不包含坐标信息，因此各发热区域均按 iPad Pro 11 英寸的布局绘制在固定位置 —— 主板位于中间、夹在两块电芯之间，充电芯片位于 USB-C 接口旁。其他 iPad 的内部结构不同。请将此图作为传感器列表的图例参考，而非 iPad 内部的真实地图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voltage at the port has collapsed well below what was negotiated, and the phone is holding the current down to keep it up. That is the cable or the plugs, not the charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "端口电压已经塌到远低于协商值，手机正压着电流以维持电压。问题出在线缆或插头，不在充电器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To 100%" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充到 100%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To 80%" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充到 80%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Units" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for the %-rate estimate, which is the sole way to see discharge power — no discharge-current sensor is exposed to a sandboxed app — and for checking the charging sensors against how fast the battery level rises. Look up your model's rating and enter it here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于百分比变化率估算（这是查看放电功率的唯一方式，沙盒应用无法访问任何放电电流传感器），也用于根据电量上升的速度核对充电传感器的读数。请查询你机型的额定能量并在此输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voltage drop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电压损失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the battery level to move twice. The forecast comes from how fast it actually rises, so it takes a few minutes to appear." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待电量变化两次。预估来自电量实际上升的速度，所以需要几分钟才会出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for the phone to draw enough to measure a drop. Below about 150 mA there is nothing to divide." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待手机取电到足以测出压降。低于约 150 mA 就没有可除的东西了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging has no cable and no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to measure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电没有线缆，也没有输入电流传感器，无从测量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worked out from how fast the level has been rising — %lld%% in the last %@. Charging slows past 80%%, so the time beyond it follows a typical charging curve and is approximate. A charge limit or Optimized Charging stops the battery short of 100%%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据电量上升的速度推算 —— 最近 %2$@ 内上升了 %1$lld%%。超过 80%% 后充电会变慢，这之后的时间按典型充电曲线估算，只是近似值。开启充电上限或优化电池充电时，电池不会充到 100%%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "—" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%@ · %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      },
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%@ for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ for %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 已持续 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ hot" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 发热"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ W in" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ W 输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ W to cell" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ W 充入电芯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld samples" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 个样本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld sensors" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 个传感器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "%lld%% → %lld%%" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$lld%% → %2$lld%%"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld%% → %2$lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%% of adapter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占适配器 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A charge session survives the app being backgrounded: it ends when you unplug, not when you switch away. Any stretch the app missed is left out of the totals rather than estimated, and the session says how much of itself was actually measured." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切到后台不会结束一次充电记录：记录在拔掉充电器时才结束，而不是在你切走时。应用没看到的那段时间会从总量中排除，而不是估算补上；每条记录都会注明其中有多少是真正测到的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A session starts when you plug in and is saved when you unplug. Energy is integrated from the live sensors, so keep WattTrace in the foreground for the totals to cover the whole charge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "插入充电器时开始记录会话，拔出时自动保存。电量数据由实时传感器积分计算得出，因此请将 WattTrace 保持在前台运行，以确保完整记录整个充电过程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Above 80% the charger tapers to constant-voltage, so low draw here is normal battery chemistry, not a weak charger." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超过 80% 后充电转入恒压涓流阶段，此时功率偏低是正常的电池特性，不是充电器不行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessories" : {
      "localizations" : {
