          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "USB-C 输入电压"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "W rated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "W 额定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wired" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging has no input-current sensor, so there is nothing to compare against the rating. The voltage and current below are the profile the pad negotiated — a ceiling that stays put while the actual draw moves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电没有输入电流传感器，因此无法与额定功率进行对比。下方的电压与电流为充电板协商的供电规格 —— 仅作为固定上限，而实际功率则会动态变动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless charging is capped well below what the adapter could deliver over the cable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电的上限远低于同一适配器通过线缆能提供的功率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless coil" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线充电线圈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入电流"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wireless input voltage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线输入电压"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock Screen and widgets" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锁定屏幕与小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live Activity while charging" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充电时显示实时活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows charge power on the Lock Screen, in the Dynamic Island and in StandBy. It updates only while WattTrace is running; once the app is suspended the reading is marked as paused rather than shown as current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在锁定屏幕、灵动岛和待机显示中显示充电功率。它只在 WattTrace 运行时更新；App 被挂起后，读数会标记为已暂停，而不会被当作当前数值显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets read the sensors themselves whenever iOS refreshes them — usually every 15 to 60 minutes — and straight away when you plug in or unplug with WattTrace open. Each one says when its numbers were taken." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小组件会在 iOS 刷新时自行读取传感器——通常每 15 到 60 分钟一次；WattTrace 打开时插拔充电器会立即刷新。每个小组件都会注明数据的读取时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Floating meter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "悬浮读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the floating meter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开悬浮读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close the floating meter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭悬浮读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device does not support Picture in Picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此设备不支持画中画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puts the reading in a floating window that stays on top of other apps and keeps updating once a second. It is the only place iOS lets an app keep a number moving while it is off screen: a widget is refreshed a few times an hour, and the Lock Screen activity only moves while WattTrace itself is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把读数放进一个悬浮窗，它浮在其他 App 上方，每秒更新一次。这是 iOS 唯一允许 App 在离开屏幕后还能让数字继续走动的地方：小组件每小时只刷新几次，锁屏实时活动也只在 WattTrace 自己运行时才会变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the window is open WattTrace keeps running, so it also records the charge with the screen locked — and it draws more power than being suspended. Close the window when you are done with it. No sound is ever played; the window uses the same system feature as a video playing in the corner, which is why the app declares audio playback at all." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "悬浮窗开着时 WattTrace 会一直运行，所以锁屏后也能继续记录这次充电，同时也比挂起时更耗电，用完请关掉它。它不会播放任何声音：悬浮窗用的是和角落里播放视频相同的系统功能，App 声明音频播放能力只是为了它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS will not open the window yet. Leave WattTrace on screen for a moment and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 现在还不让打开这个窗口。让 WattTrace 在屏幕上多停一会儿，再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free and open source" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费开源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apache 2.0 licence. The whole app, widget included, is on GitHub." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "采用 Apache 2.0 许可证，整个 App（包括小组件）的源码都在 GitHub 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
