            "value" : "布局"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Together" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同屏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate pages" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分页轮播"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select at least one item to display." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "至少选择一项显示内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose all temperatures or one component; the iOS system thermal state is always shown. Together shows power and temperatures at the same time; Separate pages alternates between them every four seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度可选择全部部件或单独一个部件，且始终显示 iOS 系统发热状态。同屏模式同时显示功率和温度；分页轮播模式每四秒切换一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Primary readout" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主要读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The compact Dynamic Island shows this reading. Press and hold it to see power, SoC, battery and hottest-component temperatures together." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "灵动岛紧凑状态显示此项读数。长按展开后可同时查看功率、SoC、电池和最高部件温度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity starts while a charger is connected and WattTrace is in front, refreshes while WattTrace runs, and marks the reading paused once the app is suspended. Unplug with WattTrace running and it ends two minutes later; unplug while it is suspended and it stays until WattTrace runs again. Tap End on the activity to close it at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接充电器且 WattTrace 位于前台时会启动实时活动，并在 WattTrace 运行期间持续刷新；App 被暂停后，读数会标记为已暂停。在 WattTrace 运行时拔下充电器，两分钟后自动结束；如果拔下时 App 已被暂停，它会一直保留，直到 WattTrace 再次运行。随时可以点实时活动上的“结束”把它关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End Live Activity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结束实时活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load + loss" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "负载与损耗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cell share" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电芯占比"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cell watts ÷ measured input watts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电芯功率 ÷ 实测输入功率"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hold status unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持状态未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No elevated system thermal pressure." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统没有升高的热压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warming up. iOS may trim performance or charge current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设备正在升温，iOS 可能降低性能或充电电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High system thermal pressure. iOS may limit charge current and clocks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高，iOS 可能限制充电电流和处理器频率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Critical thermal pressure. iOS may suspend charging until the phone cools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力达到临界值，iOS 可能暂停充电，直到设备冷却。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unrecognised system thermal state." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法识别的系统热状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High system thermal pressure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Well under the adapter's rating while system thermal pressure is high. Charge current may be limited by iOS." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统热压力较高时，功率明显低于充电器额定值。iOS 可能限制了充电电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge power below the adapter's rating right now is expected: system thermal pressure may be limiting current." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前充电功率低于适配器额定值是正常的：系统热压力可能正在限制电流。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The input sensors read %@ W while %@ W is reaching the cell, so on this model they see only part of what comes in. That figure is not shown as the input, and nothing is worked out from it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入传感器读数为 %1$@ W，而进入电芯的有 %2$@ W，说明在这个机型上它们只测到了部分输入。这个数值不会作为输入功率显示，也不会据此推算任何结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Excluded from derived temperatures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未计入推算温度的读数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature sensors answered, but every value was excluded from derived readings. See the filter details below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度传感器有响应，但所有数值都被排除在推算读数之外。详见下方的过滤说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measured at the phone's USB-C rail (VQ0u × IQ0u). The adapter value is a negotiated ceiling, not a wall-meter reading." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在手机 USB-C 供电轨上测得（VQ0u × IQ0u）。适配器的数值是协商出的上限，不是功率计的读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
